CHAPTER III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
9. Officers of the
University.---The following shall be the Officers of the University:---
(i) the Chancellor;
(ii) the
Pro-Chancellor;
(iii) the
Vice Chancellor;
(iv) the
Pro-Vice Chancellor;
(v) the
Deans;
(vi) the
Principals of the constituent colleges;
(vii) the
Vice-Principals of the constituent colleges;
(viii) the
Chairmen of the teaching departments;
(ix) the
Registrar;
(x) the
Controller of Examinations;
(xi) the
Deputy Controller of Examinations;
(xii) the
Director Planning and Development;
(xiii) the
Director of Finance;
(xiv) the
Librarian;
(xv) the
Assistant Controller of Examinations;
(xvi) the
Resident Auditor;
(xvii) the Chief Accountant;
(xviii) the Director Administration;
(xix) the
Director Student Affairs;
(xx) the
Director Legal Affairs;
(xxi) the
Director of Research;
(xxii) the Research Officer;
(xxiii) the Bursar; and
(xxiv) such persons as may be prescribed by the
regulations to be the officers.
